
###Websocket connection for user 1
WEBSOCKET {{wsUrl}}/api/v1/games/{{gameId}}/ws?token={{token1}}

###Websocket connection for user 2
WEBSOCKET {{wsUrl}}/api/v1/games/{{gameId}}/ws?token={{token2}}

###User1 makes a move
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/games/{{gameId}}/moves
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "e2",
  "to": "e4"
}

###User1 moves a black piece on black's turn (expect 400 "Not your turn")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/games/{{gameId}}/moves
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "e7", "to": "e5" }

###User2 moves a black piece on their turn (expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/games/{{gameId}}/moves
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "e7", "to": "e5" }

###User1 moves a white piece on their turn (expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/games/{{gameId}}/moves
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "h2", "to": "h4" }